<title>UK: GOLF-BRITISH OPEN FOURTH ROUND LEADERBOARD.</title>
<headline>GOLF-BRITISH OPEN FOURTH ROUND LEADERBOARD.</headline>
<text>
<p>TROON, Scotland - Fourth round leaderboard at the British</p>
<p>Open (par-71) on Sunday (British unless stated, GMT tee-offs):</p>
<p>11 under - Jesper Parnevik (Sweden) (after 67 holes)</p>
<p>10 under - Justin Leonard (U.S.) (68)</p>
<p>8 under - Darren Clarke (67)</p>
<p>5 under - Jim Furyk (U.S.) (70)</p>
<p>4 under - Padraig Harrington (Ireland) (72)</p>
<p>		Eduardo Romero (Argentina) (69)</p>
<p>		Stephen Ames (Trinidad) (69)</p>
<p>		Fred Couples (U.S.) (68)</p>
